//These are separate from the Time Echoes texts (src/time_echoes/src/include/debug_quests.c).

#org @gText_SideQuests_Empty
------\n

#org @gText_SideQuests_LostChild
Bambino sperduto

#org @gText_SideQuests_LostChildDesc
Aiuta la ragazza di Miralba a\ntrovare il suo fratellino.

#org @gText_SideQuests_LostScroll
